WEBVTT

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:14.080
At long last, I've found you!

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.330
I must say, I did not think

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:19.120
you would be able to find
my wavelength in the sea of fragments.

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:29.170
Learning that Vier had lost
her memories truly spoiled my fun.

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:37.640
What are you doing?

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:41.940
Isn't it obvious?
We both have pieces on the board.

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:47.530
Let us joyfully watch them
destroy one another.

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:00.210
Rika!

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:06.800
What a delectable reaction.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:11.090
A game needs its players, after all.

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:43.010
HIGURASHI: WHEN THEY CRY SOTSU

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:56.400
Why?

00:02:56.400 --> 00:03:01.790
Why am I the only one
who has to go through all this?

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:08.080
What grave sin did I commit...

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:12.130
...to be punished to an eternity of <i>this</i>?

00:03:12.130 --> 00:03:16.930
Okay, Rika-<i>chan</i>. You have to tell me now.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:20.510
Where's the secret cure
that gets rid of these parasites?!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:26.270
How do I purge these maggots
crawling around in my throat?!

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:35.360
Sure, I'll tell you.
The cure's right here.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:39.530
In where?! Where is it?! Give it to me!

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:42.200
My throat's filling up with maggots!

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:45.540
It's so itchy, so freakin' itchy!

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.170
Right in here.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.960
Inside my head.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:59.760
Split open my skull and
eat my brains, and you'll be cured.

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:04.720
It's in there?!

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:08.940
So <i>that's </i>where it was!

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:10.730
Rika!

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:26.410
You see that, you damn bugs?!
I just gotta take the cure...

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:29.160
It's so freakin' itchy!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:32.500
This'll work... wait.

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:37.880
This is better.

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:51.730
Grab him! Grab him!

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:53.560
Get outta my way!

00:04:55.070 --> 00:05:01.320
I just want to get rid of these bugs!

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:04.700
They just keep coming!

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.870
What is going on in this world?!

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:16.420
What have you done?!

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:18.960
Are you not entertained?

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:22.880
Fear not, the real fun is about to begin.

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.180
Huh?

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:29.060
Let go of me!

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:34.480
S-Satoko...?

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:39.270
Oh, dear.

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:42.110
You bastards, let me go--

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:45.240
Not again! They're crawling out again!

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.370
Stop resisting! You're done!

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:50.370
It's gotten quite lively in here.

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:58.550
Poor Rika, all alone.

00:05:58.550 --> 00:06:02.760
There's no one to support
your fragile heart anymore.

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:06.600
In every world, in every fragment,

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:09.850
I'm your only ally.

00:06:09.850 --> 00:06:11.350
No!

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:15.600
Just give up already, Rika.

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:20.190
The key to your happiness lies with me.

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:24.990
I'll make sure you come
to that understanding!

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.790
What have you done?

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:36.750
You granted power to Satoko?!

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:39.880
Just as you did to Rika, yes?

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:42.880
Yes, but that was a mistake.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:46.430
And what you've done is a mistake, too!

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:51.720
You would dare suggest
I have acted in error?

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:54.940
Choose your words carefully,
my dear failure.

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:59.190
I may be a failure,
but I still have <i>some </i>power!

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:15.080
Long ago, you diverted one of
Takano's bullets to protect your friends.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:20.210
Did you believe an opportunity to
protect them would randomly occur again?

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:26.050
That power wasn't random chance!
You couldn't understand it!

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:28.890
Such insolence.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:35.730
Though it pains me to admit,
you <i>are </i>a part of me.

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:39.730
I will allow you to enjoy the spectacle
from your front-row seat.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:57.500
Hey. You're finally awake.

00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:00.040
It's almost sundown.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:03.550
Satoko? I...

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:06.260
You were tossing and turning so much.

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:09.550
You must have had a terrible nightmare.

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:14.180
My, you have quite the fever!

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:20.600
I'll stay here by your side until
you feel better, if that's all right.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.110
Satoko...

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:29.110
Poor, poor Rika.

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:34.200
Why? Why is this happening to me?!

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:40.870
I don't know what
you were dreaming about...

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:45.670
...but surely you know
your dreams are important.

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.170
Huh?

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:51.640
Your dreams are the way
they are for a reason.

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:54.470
A very important reason, Rika.

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:57.600
A reason? What kind of reasoning...

00:08:58.520 --> 00:09:04.520
...justifies being tortured
by these horrible, tragic realities?!

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:12.160
You don't know why you suffer through
terrible dreams, night after night?

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:14.910
S-Satoko, what are you--

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:20.080
M-My body... everything hurts!

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:24.500
These horrible dreams are torturing you,

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:28.260
and you still don't know the reason
why they are doing so?

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:32.800
What's going on...?

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:35.550
Rika, you've been cursed.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:39.850
C-Cursed? What do... you mean...?

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:43.270
Why?!

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:48.690
I can't... move! What's... happening?!

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:51.530
Oh, you mean this?

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:53.740
Huh?

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:01.790
It's time, Rika...

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.130
...for the <i>watanagashi </i>ritual.

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:10.170
Stop! Don't go any further! Satoko!

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.840
You're Oyashiro-<i>sama</i>, are you not?

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:17.050
Your newest priest is simply going
to perform the offertory dance.

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:20.930
Wouldn't you agree it's your duty
to observe it to its completion?

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:25.230
You must come to terms
with the truth, Rika.

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:29.020
This nightmare was not
foisted upon you on a whim.

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:31.150
Satoko, please!

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:33.240
You have sinned, Rika,

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:35.610
and this is your eternal punishment!

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.910
Stop! Make it stop!

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:42.910
Are you making demands of me?

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:48.500
Know your place.
You will <i>not </i>avert your eyes.

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:08.650
Should I let you move your mouth?

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.650
Rika!

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.900
Rika, Rika, Rika!

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:18.700
I'm sorry, I'm sorry,
I'm sorry, I'm sorry...

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:26.620
Please, stop! Make it stop!

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:29.960
If this doesn't stop,
Rika's mind will break!

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.710
Stop it, stop it, stop it!

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:36.470
Please, I'm begging you!

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:39.720
Don't make Satoko do this!

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:47.690
Satoko is Rika's best friend!

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:51.980
She's always stood by her side
and supported her, no matter what!

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:53.730
So please, you can't...

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:58.570
You are so very entertaining!

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:04.660
Don't make Rika's best friend
hurt her anymore!

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:07.040
I'm sorry...

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:09.870
I was wrong...

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:15.760
Rika?!

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:20.430
If you'd go this far, Satoko...

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:23.180
I finally realize.

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:27.520
All I want is to live here
in Hinamizawa with you, Rika.

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:30.730
I don't need anything else.

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:35.690
Yeah. I'm sorry.

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:37.110
It's all right!

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:42.910
I'm sure your words of repentance will
grant you Oyashiro-<i>sama</i>'s forgiveness!

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:52.380
I won't make that mistake again...

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:05.680
Please burn those words into your mind,

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:09.100
until you're <i>certain</i>
you won't forget them!

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:14.980
Rika...

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:29.830
We had so much fun today!

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:32.580
Too much fun. I really tired myself out.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:36.750
You said you needed to talk to
me earlier, yes?

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:41.800
I'm sure you won't have any idea
what I'm talking about...

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:45.640
...but please, just hear me out
until the end.

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:57.020
Rika, no...

00:13:57.020 --> 00:14:02.030
I had two very, very long dreams.

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:06.240
One was a dream that was very painful
for me when I was dreaming it.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:11.870
But looking back on it now, I know
it was full of shiny, sparkling wonders.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:15.170
In the other dream, I never noticed
those shining wonders,

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:19.550
and I was punished for clinging to
an ungrateful dream.

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:22.130
This nightmare lasted a long, long time.

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:25.220
Please, you have to
realize what's happening!

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:31.680
Why did I ever dream of anything else?

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:34.480
Rika...

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:44.070
I don't know what kind of dreams
you've been having,

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:48.370
but no matter what happens,
I'll always be your friend.

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:51.120
That goes for Hinamizawa
and everyone else, too.

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:54.370
We'll love you forever and ever, Rika.

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:58.590
Rika... that world isn't right!

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:07.680
I'm sure you won't have any more
nightmares from now on.

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:11.310
Satoko!

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:19.940
That's not the world you chose,
the world where you won your own future!

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:26.320
You have to see that, Rika!

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:27.860
'Tis futile.

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:32.990
However would the cat discover that
Satoko is the cause of her suffering?

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:35.540
What reason does she have?

